      "dashboard_url": "https://monitor.omi.me/d/omi-core-features",
      "summary": "Enforced retry caps are quarantining or failing more than 50 units in 30 minutes.",
      "user_impact": "Affected recordings keep their audio but wait in a held state instead of retrying; sync uploads end failed and need a re-upload or operator redrive.",
      "scope": "Counts committed cap decisions with outcome=quarantine across batch lease expiry and sync checks. Enforced for every uid only with CAPTURE_RETRY_CAP_ENFORCED on (default off); otherwise the CAPTURE_COVERAGE_MODE cohort. Agent tier only.",
